  "details": "Description\n\nWhen I share my VRChat screen on Discord, the anti-cheat system triggers a false positive and VRChat crashes.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nIf you select VRchat for screen sharing during a Discord voice chat, there's a high chance the anti-cheat system will falsely flag it.\n\nThe main ways to work around this are to use OBS's VirtualCamera or to avoid screen sharing altogether.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: その他\n\n- Frequency: しばしば\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p2-1938-565822d00a-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-10_14-16-45.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_c55a8678-a751-4004-989b-65cddcbc87af/1/file)",
